expect Backgammon
tap Match
expect Turn history
tap How to play
expect Move all 15 checkers home
wait 250
clean
shot backgammon-help
tap Play
tap Roll
expect opened with
clean
shot backgammon-opening
scenario storage-full
tap Computer move
expect Progress is not saved
clean
shot backgammon-save-refused
scenario normal
tap Roll
expect-missing Progress is not saved
clean
shot backgammon-save-kept
